ow  to help you re-imagine this idea  observe your current workflow over a few  days  benchmark the current standard  processing times and the number and  complexity of manual steps  no potentials for intra operational and  inter operational variability  by minimizing the human variable and  removing opportunities for human error  automation encourages reproducibility  repeatability and replicability  and inspires credibility  i remember furiously scribbling notes  into my lab notebook trying to capture  every critical detail of the  experimental steps in my proto of my  protocol as you can see marie curie had  the same process backwards when she was  discovering radium  today  automated instrumentation can be your  partner in producing and tracking  critical data such as recording process  steps during a run what reagents you use  how long and time in terms of how long  did things run for and temperatures  also documenting protocol parameter data  optimization by automation by automating  your workflow can add consistency and  reproducibility to your research  why optimize workflow through automation  foundations first  automation can be a powerful tool in the  lab  but be careful  think about reproducibility in terms of  a copy machine  they don't understand what they're  copying  they just copy  optimized workflows through automation  can replicate quality results  but  non-optimized workflow using automation  will replicate suboptimal results  consistently  we've talked about a few frameworks for  inspiring credibility and research and a  few tips and tricks for how automation  can impact research  as a wrap-up here are three easy steps  to inspire confidence and credibility  first  reproducibility of results over time  second optimize optimization of  automation for optims for operational  efficiency  and third  and most one of the most important is  trustworthiness  and not just within the research you're  doing but also within the field as an  author that you